Template: anonyx/mode
Type: select
Choices: strict, paranoid, transparent
Default: strict
Description: Default killswitch mode?
 strict drops everything except Tor. paranoid also drops DHCP and
 randomizes MACs. transparent redirects TCP/DNS through Tor.

Template: anonyx/netns
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Isolate Tor in a network namespace?
 Stronger isolation, needs iproute2 + nftables. Leave off unless you
 know policy routing.
